<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian inflation rises to 8.9 pct yr/yr in May.</title>
<headline>Slovenian inflation rises to 8.9 pct yr/yr in May.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Friday.</p>
<p>RETAIL PRICE INFLATION</p>
<p> (changes in percent)	   May     April     May 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	  1.3	2.0	 0.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	    8.9	8.2	10.9</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
